-- 108. OPUS — SAT_DOCUMENT_DEFINITION   [Implemented]
-- Mode -- single-active: every current vault row must equal one source row of its (hash
-- key, record source). 9 column(s) compared. 3 RAW branch(es): BJAZ_T_KYC_OCR,
-- BJAZ_T_KYC_POA_DOCUMENT, BJAZ_T_KYC_POI_DOCUMENT.
